@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5032
@authToken = eyJhbGciOi...

### =========================================================================
### AUTH MODULE
### =========================================================================

### 1. Register New User (Step 1: Receive OTP)
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@aistudyhub.com",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123@",
  "firstName": "Văn A",
  "lastName": "Nguyễn",
  "role": "Student"
}

### 2. Verify OTP (Step 2: Create Account)
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@aistudyhub.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 3. Login
# @name login
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@aistudyhub.com",
  "password": "Password123@"
}

### 4. Get Current User Profile
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Forgot Password
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@aistudyhub.com"
}

### 6. Reset Password
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@aistudyhub.com",
  "otp": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123@"
}

### 7. Logout (Blacklist Token)
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### =========================================================================
### SUBJECTS MODULE
### =========================================================================

### 8. Get All Subjects
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Create New Subject
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PRN212 - Basic Cross-Platform Application with .NET",
  "description": "C# Programming, WPF, WebAPI, and Clean Architecture."
}


### =========================================================================
### DOCUMENTS MODULE
### =========================================================================

### 10. Get My Documents
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Get Document Details By ID
@documentId = 01920000-0000-7000-8000-000000000000
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Update Document Metadata
PUT {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "PRN212 Slide Chapter 1 - Updated",
  "subjectId": "01920000-0000-7000-8000-000000000000",
  "isPublic": true
}

### 13. Soft Delete Document
DELETE {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}